	(text "PIC32MK + power module: POC #1 (docs/requirements.md 4.0). Plugs into every POC board via J3/J4.\nRACK domain: +12V / GND_RACK (12 V input, protection). LOGIC domain (floating): +5V from U20, +3V3 from U2, GND.\nCircuits copied from the can-controller schematic (MCU and power sheets). Pinout: module_pinout.py."
