	(text "U20 (9-36 V in, 5 V 1 A, 1600 VDC) is the only RACK | LOGIC crossing. Remote On/Off (pin 4) open = on.\nNo traces under it (TRACO). 1 A on +5V is shared by this module (~0.1 A) and the host."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 96.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
