	(text "J3/J4: 2 x 20, 2.54 mm sockets on the module BOTTOM; pin headers on the host.\nKeying: J4 sits 1 mm off the 180-degree position of J3, and J3.9 is blocked\n(cut pin glued into the socket) with no pin on the host. J3.10 is unused: it\nspaces the RACK pins (J3.1-8) from the LOGIC pins."
